1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:02,420
Maya's AI support bot just told

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:03,540
a customer they can get a

3
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:05,619
refund after sixty days.

4
00:00:05,699 --> 00:00:07,939
Her company's policy is thirty.

5
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:09,299
Maya is sure the fix is

6
00:00:09,459 --> 00:00:10,379
a bigger model.

7
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:11,940
So she pays for one.

8
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:13,060
Same question.

9
00:00:13,219 --> 00:00:14,660
Same confident answer.

10
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:15,860
Sixty days.

11
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:17,513
And that's when it hits her.

12
00:00:17,567 --> 00:00:19,007
The model isn't dumb.

13
00:00:19,033 --> 00:00:20,420
It has never read her refund

14
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:21,340
policy.

15
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:22,980
So she tries a trick called

16
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:23,740
RAG.

17
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:25,140
Before the bot answers,

18
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:26,580
it searches her documents,

19
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:28,420
grabs the three paragraphs that match

20
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:29,033
best,

21
00:00:29,087 --> 00:00:30,460
and reads them first.

22
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:32,420
Every paragraph is stored as numbers

23
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,887
that capture its meaning,

24
00:00:33,913 --> 00:00:35,220
so it finds the right one

25
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:37,580
even when customers use different words.

26
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:39,380
Now every answer comes with its

27
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:40,140
source.

28
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:41,673
And when the policy changes,

29
00:00:41,727 --> 00:00:43,340
she just updates the document.

30
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:44,500
No retraining.

31
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:44,980
Now,

32
00:00:45,060 --> 00:00:46,340
when someone tells Maya they need

33
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:47,340
a bigger model,

34
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:49,380
she asks one question: has it

35
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:50,700
read your documents?

36
00:00:50,740 --> 00:00:51,860
Follow.

37
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:52,220
Next,

38
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:54,020
I'll explain AI agents.

